  "rules": [
    "Registration actions and Tournament flow states remain separate subfamilies.",
    "Each Tournament action or state ID owns exactly one Green canonical PNG identity.",
    "The unregister return arrow is not a consumable Undo token.",
    "The Tournament start play triangle is not a Rewarded Video ticket.",
    "The completed-match check is not a Treasury ownership, invitation acceptance or generic winner mark.",
    "Use the canonical runtime pack instead of copying or recoloring individual Tournament state glyphs."
  ]
